rigin_country":["AU","GB"],"original_language":"en","original_name":"Frayed","overview":"Fabulously wealthy London housewife Sammy, is forced to return to the town in Australia she grew up in. But in coming home, Sammy must revisit her past and the events that led her to flee as a teenager years ago.","popularity":8.8795,"poster_path":"/g4cdvm4RGeIs3n5NwIYroFoaum3.jpg","first_air_date":"2019-09-26","softcore":false,"name":"Frayed","vote_average":7.2,"vote_count":33},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/jAz9AZpznu3ELhUp1XiMEeQv2Se.jpg","genre_ids":[80,18,10759],"id":93544,"origin_country":["GB"],"original_language":"en","original_name":"Top Boy","overview":"Two seasoned drug dealers return to the gritty street of London, but their pursuit of money and power is threatened by a young and ruthless hustler.","popularity":13.0721,"poster_path":"/iQ9vE3swuwrAE7Bvun2lF1C1oe3.jpg","first_air_date":"2019-09-13","softcore":false,"name":"Top Boy","vote_average":7.991,"vote_count":167},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/9ixh4ozQQhGKW2YX1d9AiOvcalv.jpg","genre_ids":[18,35],"id":93704,"origin_country":["GB"],"original_language":"en","original_name":"Trigonometry","overview":"In crowded and expensive London, cash-strapped couple Gemma and Kieran open their small apartment to a third person. Somehow, their new addition, Ray, makes the flat seem bigger, not smaller. Gradually, many things become easier, nicer and better with an extra pair of hands.","popularity":5.8901,"poster_path":"/1VoKtxF99V0mige4JtWnPfEeWgV.jpg","first_air_date":"2020-03-15","softcore":false,"name":"Trigonometry","vote_average":6.4,"vote_count":24},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/b2L2tMt01dD2jFM80kpbZpXjiD5.jpg","genre_ids":[16,18],"id":29310,"origin_country":["JP"],"original_language":"ja","original_name":"英國戀物語エマ","overview":"In 19th-century London, class lines are sharply drawn, and the social standing to which people are born dictates the path their lives will follow. Emma, an honest and hardworking young maid, never felt her place in life to be a burden. But then she met William, a member of the gentry and the eldest son of a wealthy family. His warm smile and earnest affection threaten to capture her heart... but can love truly conquer all?","popularity":29.0233,"poster_path":"/sbEsRPkypIVezOh6h5fZZN7LjUw.jpg","first_air_date":"2005-04-03","softcore":false,"name":"Emma: A Victorian Romance","vote_average":6,"vote_count":23},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"genre_ids":[18],"id":278754,"origin_country":["GB"],"original_language":"en","original_name":"Shadow of the Noose","overview":"A look at the real cases and personal demons of Sir Edward Marshall Hall, Edwardian London's most celebrated barrister. Presiding over trials that made headlines and drew large crowds to the public gallery, the Old Bailey defence counsel was Britain's first legal celebrity. A champion of justice for all, Marshall Hall earns a reputation as The Great Defender as he pleads the innocence of clients other lawyers refuse to represent.","popularity":5.4276,"poster_path":"/wPSA7VlOZ4bDuq813QaWbQ65NPO.jpg","first_air_date":"1989-02-28","softcore":false,"name":"Shadow of the Noose","vote_average":9,"vote_count":1},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/mkhT6YETfnvcox56THaVon6NrKF.jpg","genre_ids":[16,10759,18,10765],"id":128024,"origin_country":["US"],"original_language":"en","original_name":"Unicorn: Warriors Eternal","overview":"An evil force is looming across the dark, thick-aired streets of industrial revolution London when a group of heroes dubbed Unicorn are accidentally reawakened in the bodies of teenagers instead of adult hosts they’ve embodied in the past.","popularity":10.4049,"poster_path":"/w0uHVrvCQYAWA4gj4j1GOCFM54a.jpg","first_air_date":"2023-05-05","softcore":false,"name":"Unicorn: Warriors Eternal","vote_average":7.2,"vote_count":55},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/A2qdFRq9oJDC5E7fbgSS4POUMDF.jpg","genre_ids":[80,18,9648],"id":1426,"origin_country":["GB"],"original_language":"en","original_name":"Luther","overview":"A dark psychological crime drama starring Idris Elba as Luther, a man struggling with his own terrible demons, who might be as dangerous as the depraved murderers he hunts.","popularity":23.9954,"poster_path":"/hDxOMX8zzH1FiqKWVBzNaYGBkle.jpg","first_air_date":"2010-05-04","softcore":false,"name":"Luther","vote_average":7.859,"vote_count":1268},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/rz9zHmDVPF9F3xqxHBw02MPuW0J.jpg","genre_ids":[80,18],"id":61246,"origin_country":["GB"],"original_language":"en","original_name":"Lucan","overview":"Belgravia, London, November 7th, 1974. Sandra Rivett, nanny of the aristocratic Lucan family, is found beaten to death. Shortly thereafter, the prime suspect, John Bingham, 7th Earl of Lucan, mysteriously disappears. When the manhunt begins, the subsequent scandal shakes the foundations of the British ruling class like never before.","popularity":4.0678,"poster_path":"/5NUyxKOoaaZqGjy2D6lm1LtyEiU.jpg","first_air_date":"2013-12-11","softcore":false,"name":"Lucan","vote_average":7.1,"vote_count":14},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/lqlvnU37uw9timHjtDv3N1fQr7L.jpg","genre_ids":[18],"id":61498,"origin_country":["GB"],"original_language":"en","original_name":"The Great Fire","overview":"In 1666, against the decadent backdrop of King Charles II’s court and centering on the circumstances that lead to the catastrophic fire, Thomas Farriner deals with family at the bakery in Pudding Lane, the playboy King’s extravagant lifestyle, and Farriner’s complex relationship with his fictional sister-in-law, Sarah.","popularity":7.3598,"poster_path":"/6TIv02dbPkhdNbxWgBfU6bQM4rP.jpg","first_air_date":"2014-10-16","softcore":false,"name":"The Great Fire","vote_average":6.9,"vote_count":13},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/2ECsYV9dRb0YKF0stV7fzB4mX3y.jpg","genre_ids":[80,18],"id":61448,"origin_country":["GB"],"original_language":"en","original_name":"Suspects","overview":"Set in London, each episode is a self-contained story, starting with a news report, then following the team of three detectives as they investigate the circumstances the crime. The cases themselves are hard-hitting with contemporary themes, such as the search for a soldier with PTSD, a murder that has been made to look like an assisted suicide and the gang rape of a young teenager.","popularity":7.2178,"poster_path":"/yak88sPje9rEc8pHHE8dGIjg19f.jpg","first_air_date":"2014-02-12","softcore":false,"name":"Suspects","vote_average":5.6,"vote_count":23},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/82mg4AYmbk2azKxEsYk3P1Q68V9.jpg","genre_ids":[18],"id":61567,"origin_country":["GB"],"original_language":"en","original_name":"Breathless","overview":"Hospital drama set in London during the early 1960s, following the staff of a busy gynecology ward at a time when abortion is illegal and the contraceptive pill is only just becoming available to married women.","popularity":4.2941,"poster_path":"/sy40B7GO96d9jH7Z87TlMyAeSD9.jpg","first_air_date":"2013-10-10","softcore":false,"name":"Breathless","vote_average":6.8,"vote_count":9},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/dHMJFx5QAgNQ7BA349sk94KmFuh.jpg","genre_ids":[18,35],"id":1721,"origin_country":["GB","US"],"original_language":"en","original_name":"Keen Eddie","overview":"Keen Eddie is an American action, comedy-drama television series that aired in 2003 on the Fox Network. The series follows a brash NYPD detective who goes to London when one of his cases goes sour and remains to work with New Scotland Yard. The basic premise of the show bears a close resemblance to the popular 1980s British series Dempsey & Makepeace, the only notable difference being that the female partner has been replaced by a female housemate. Stylistically, the series derived inspiration from British feature films by Guy Ritchie, such as Lock, Stock and Two Smoking Barrels and Snatch. The soundtrack and incidental music for the first episode was provided by British techno duo Orbital. Daniel Ash of Love and Rockets scored the rest of the